Subject: [PATCH] docs: add AGENTS.md for the staging4 patch queue

Rewrites the fork conventions for staging4: the branch is an upstream tag
plus one commit per fork patch with raft-patches/ as the source of truth,
series ordering, how to add, refresh, drop and backport patches, rebasing
onto a new upstream tag, the per-commit DCO/linear-history PR gate,
English-only PR titles, no local Gradle, and the release-set rules. The
stale staging2/staging3 delivery rules are removed.

